    "name": "Ashley Tang Menteng Jakarta",
    "detail": "I had a pleasant stay at Ashley Tang Menteng. The hotel is clean, smells nice, and has a unique interior design. Check-in was quick, I arrived around 4 PM and got my room (920) right away. The room was clean, comfortable, the AC worked perfectly, and the pillows were super comfy. Amenities were complete as well. The staff were friendly and helpful. One small downside was the bath towel is a bit thin. The gym only had dumbbells, so it’s quite limited if you plan to lift seriously. Breakfast was standard but it does the job. Just a heads-up: if you’re heading to the airport, leave earlier because the traffic in front of the hotel can get very congested. Overall, it was a pleasant and worthwhile stay for the price and location.",
